# QA-A-234 (#253): clang-tidy configuration for modules/common. CI compares the findings with a baseline of (check, file, message, flagged line) and fails on a new one.
Checks: '-*,bugprone-*,clang-analyzer-*,performance-*'
# bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters stays ON (QA-A-234c): switching it off hid every future argument-order slip in
# internal functions. The findings that exist today are in the CI baseline; a new one fails the gate.
CheckOptions:
  # A catch (...) that swallows an exception carries a comment with this marker and the reason.
  - key: bugprone-empty-catch.IgnoreCatchWithKeywords
    value: '@TODO;@FIXME;[no-throw-boundary]'
HeaderFilterRegex: 'modules[/\\](common|preprocess)[/\\]'
